{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dice are cast, and your sanity is slipping. Welcome to a world woven from chaos and secrets\u2014where every investigation is a gamble with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us. Become part of the legend. If you\u2019re itching to dive deeper into discussions or stay updated, come hang out in our community:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Squad Group 1: 557867027<br>Detective Squad Group 2: 738595060</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Ready to begin your investigation?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong><br>Detective Shen Libang, along with his assistant Chris and the mysterious girl Alice, steps into the darkest corners of the city. His goal is not only to find his missing family but to tear away the world\u2019s disguise and face the unspeakable horror lurking behind the curtain. Your choices will determine whether he becomes a hero\u2026 or just another soul lost to madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Experience: Tactical RPG \u00d7 Dynamic Storytelling</strong><br>This game deeply blends <strong>SLG tactical gameplay</strong> with the essence of <strong>tabletop role-playing (TRPG)</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Investigation:</strong> Plan every move across grid-based scenes. Move, explore, interact with characters, and gather scattered clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Dice Checks:</strong> The heart of the game. Every critical action is resolved through a sophisticated dice-rolling system influenced by your skills, status, environment, and even pure luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/0a0e3d75b61e9f0dd5a18b7c96c27d02.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Every case holds several unique outcomes. Will you achieve a perfect resolution, trigger a tragedy, or uncover the deepest hidden truth? Replay and explore every possibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/2ac62357811daa6ad34ee154d3576a1b.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/2737307d9aca582e8e12f04abb5a9211.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Interaction &amp; Clue Networks:</strong> Almost everything in the environment can be examined. A note, a scratch, a whispered word\u2014any could be key. Connect related clues to uncover hidden truths and drive the story forward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/912a4da8b51b4723ab7a287219df9ad0.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Investigators:</strong> Recruit distinct allies\u2014a sporty college jock with brute strength, a lively detective assistant, a university girl who sees the \u201cunseeable.\u201d Build your ultimate team to face different threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/475e70f03e5337552d15f6b01b67cb5c.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Items &amp; Risky Arcana:</strong> Use over 60 types of items to aid your investigation. But beware: some scrolls containing ancient rituals can turn the tide\u2026 or backfire terribly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/531eb412295f9b7de1b6d168719393fc.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/6def6516891f4484b489cec582abd777.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World of Friends &amp; Foes:</strong> Interact with NPCs, each with their own secrets. Is that polite professor or cheerful bunny-eared maid really here to help\u2026 or to lead you into a trap? Trust is the rarest currency here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/3b7d0d220a49a34a2b7b616897835409.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Encounters:</strong> When faced with the unspeakable, engage in tense turn-based combat. Carefully plan positioning, skills, and item use to seize a glimmer of hope in the despair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/extras/e5080f1c1e32d7d6a89543989f594127.avif?t=1765359889\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1976540?t=1765359889","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976540/c456c35da8bd13ab9c14e71ee19498d95f85becb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765359889","capsul